We can use this to find the derivative of the function as shown below.

$\begin{align}
h(x)&=\dfrac{d}{dx}[6\log(x)]
\\\\
&=6\dfrac{d}{dx}[\log(x)]
\\\\
&=6\dfrac{d}{dx}[\log_{10}(x)]&&\small{\gray{\text{Since }\log(x)=\log_{10}(x)}}
\\\\
&=6\cdot\dfrac{1}{\ln(10)x}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{6}{x\ln(10)}
\end{align}$
